✅ What's Better Than Mobile Contract:
1. Simpler message format - { id, method, params } vs nested payload structures
2. Request/Response pattern - Clean, predictable, easy to implement
3. Generic methods - One API for file, git, browser, cache operations
4. HTTP fallback - /api/agent for non-real-time needs
5. Streaming is optional - Not forced into everything
